The error message indicates that the `policy` argument is not supported in the `aws_iam_group` resource.

To fix this issue, we can remove the `policy` argument as it is not needed for an IAM group. IAM groups do not have policies associated with them; policies are typically associated with IAM roles, users, or inline policies.

Here is the corrected Terraform HCL:

```hcl
terraform {
  required_version = ">= 1.5.0"
  required_providers {
    aws = { source = "hashicorp/aws", version = "~> 5.0" }
  }
}

provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

variable "group_name" {
  type    = string
  default = "example-group"
}

variable "path" {
  type    = string
  default = "/"
}

resource "aws_iam_group" "example_group" {
  name  = var.group_name
  path  = var.path
}
```

This corrected configuration will create an IAM group with the specified name and path.

